{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31515","headline":"腊夜雪霁月彩交光开阁临轩竟睡不得命家仆吹笙数曲独引一壶奉寄江陵副使杜中丞 · 李羣玉","name":"腊夜雪霁月彩交光开阁临轩竟睡不得命家仆吹笙数曲独引一壶奉寄江陵副使杜中丞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月华临霁雪，皓彩射貂裘。\n桂酒寒无醉，银笙冻不流。\n怀哉梁苑客，思作剡溪游。\n竟夕吟琼树，川途恨阻修。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李羣玉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31515.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31515","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}